  "permlink": "https://cafe.daum.net/sedu22/F1n/208",
  "contentHtml": "<p><span style=\"color: rgb(85, 85, 85); font-family: Gulim, 굴림, AppleGothic, sans-serif; font-size: 10pt; line-height: 21px;\">지난 금요일 동아리 시간에 한 활동입니다.</span></p><p style=\"text-align: left;\"><span style=\"font-family: Gulim, 굴림, AppleGothic, sans-serif; font-size: 10pt;\">학교선생님들과 의견교환해가며 아이디어가 점점 좋아졌습니다.</span><br></p><p><br style=\"color: rgb(85, 85, 85); font-family: 나눔고딕, NanumGothic, NanumGothicOTF, 'Apple Gothic', 맑은고딕, 'Malgun Gothic', dotum, Arial, verdana, 'Trebuchet MS', 'Lucida Grande', HelveticaNeue, Tahoma, Helvetica, 'hiragino kaku gothic pro', sans-serif, 'Apple Color Emoji', 'Segoe UI Emoji', NotoColorEmoji, 'Segoe UI Symbol', 'Android Emoji', EmojiSymbols; font-size: 14px; line-height: 21px;\"><span style=\"color: rgb(85, 85, 85); font-family: Gulim, 굴림, AppleGothic, sans-serif; font-size: 10pt; line-height: 21px;\">동아사이언스에 '친환경수질검사'키트가 있어요. &nbsp;질산은 수용액으로 염소검사하고, 네슬러시약이라는 걸로 암모늄이온 검사할 수 있는 초간단 수질검사라 싸요. 10인용 2만 몇천원.&nbsp;</span><br style=\"color: rgb(85, 85, 85); font-family: 나눔고딕, NanumGothic, NanumGothicOTF, 'Apple Gothic', 맑은고딕, 'Malgun Gothic', dotum, Arial, verdana, 'Trebuchet MS', 'Lucida Grande', HelveticaNeue, Tahoma, Helvetica, 'hiragino kaku gothic pro', sans-serif, 'Apple Color Emoji', 'Segoe UI Emoji', NotoColorEmoji, 'Segoe UI Symbol', 'Android Emoji', EmojiSymbols; font-size: 14px; line-height: 21px;\"><br style=\"color: rgb(85, 85, 85); font-family: 나눔고딕, NanumGothic, NanumGothicOTF, 'Apple Gothic', 맑은고딕, 'Malgun Gothic', dotum, Arial, verdana, 'Trebuchet MS', 'Lucida Grande', HelveticaNeue, Tahoma, Helvetica, 'hiragino kaku gothic pro', sans-serif, 'Apple Color Emoji', 'Segoe UI Emoji', NotoColorEmoji, 'Segoe UI Symbol', 'Android Emoji', EmojiSymbols; font-size: 14px; line-height: 21px;\"><span style=\"color: rgb(85, 85, 85); font-family: Gulim, 굴림, AppleGothic, sans-serif; font-size: 10pt; line-height: 21px;\">동아리 애들한테 이틀전에 물약병을 나눠주고 집근처 야외(하천, 우물, 고인물)에서 물을 떠와라, 없으면 집에서 수돗물이라도 떠와라 그랬구요.&nbsp;</span><br style=\"color: rgb(85, 85, 85); font-family: 나눔고딕, NanumGothic, NanumGothicOTF, 'Apple Gothic', 맑은고딕, 'Malgun Gothic', dotum, Arial, verdana, 'Trebuchet MS', 'Lucida Grande', HelveticaNeue, Tahoma, Helvetica, 'hiragino kaku gothic pro', sans-serif, 'Apple Color Emoji', 'Segoe UI Emoji', NotoColorEmoji, 'Segoe UI Symbol', 'Android Emoji', EmojiSymbols; font-size: 14px; line-height: 21px;\"><br style=\"color: rgb(85, 85, 85); font-family: 나눔고딕, NanumGothic, NanumGothicOTF, 'Apple Gothic', 맑은고딕, 'Malgun Gothic', dotum, Arial, verdana, 'Trebuchet MS', 'Lucida Grande', HelveticaNeue, Tahoma, Helvetica, 'hiragino kaku gothic pro', sans-serif, 'Apple Color Emoji', 'Segoe UI Emoji', NotoColorEmoji, 'Segoe UI Symbol', 'Android Emoji', EmojiSymbols; font-size: 14px; line-height: 21px;\"><span style=\"color: rgb(85, 85, 85); font-family: Gulim, 굴림, AppleGothic, sans-serif; font-size: 10pt; line-height: 21px;\">학교에서 질산은용액넣어 염화은침전물 찾았더니 확실히 수돗물에 흰색 앙금이 많이 생겼구요(사진속 왼쪽 건 야외, 오른쪽은 수돗물)</span><br style=\"color: rgb(85, 85, 85); font-family: 나눔고딕, NanumGothic, NanumGothicOTF, 'Apple Gothic', 맑은고딕, 'Malgun Gothic', dotum, Arial, verdana, 'Trebuchet MS', 'Lucida Grande', HelveticaNeue, Tahoma, Helvetica, 'hiragino kaku gothic pro', sans-serif, 'Apple Color Emoji', 'Segoe UI Emoji', NotoColorEmoji, 'Segoe UI Symbol', 'Android Emoji', EmojiSymbols; font-size: 14px; line-height: 21px;\"><br style=\"color: rgb(85, 85, 85); font-family: 나눔고딕, NanumGothic, NanumGothicOTF, 'Apple Gothic', 맑은고딕, 'Malgun Gothic', dotum, Arial, verdana, 'Trebuchet MS', 'Lucida Grande', HelveticaNeue, Tahoma, Helvetica, 'hiragino kaku gothic pro', sans-serif, 'Apple Color Emoji', 'Segoe UI Emoji', NotoColorEmoji, 'Segoe UI Symbol', 'Android Emoji', EmojiSymbols; font-size: 14px; line-height: 21px;\"><span style=\"color: rgb(85, 85, 85); font-family: Gulim, 굴림, AppleGothic, sans-serif; font-size: 10pt; line-height: 21px;\">거기다 좀 있다 네슬러시약넣었더니 야외에서 떠 온 물에 갈색 침전물이 조금씩 생겼어요. (물속&nbsp;아미노산 검출)&nbsp;</span><br style=\"color: rgb(85, 85, 85); font-family: 나눔고딕, NanumGothic, NanumGothicOTF, 'Apple Gothic', 맑은고딕, 'Malgun Gothic', dotum, Arial, verdana, 'Trebuchet MS', 'Lucida Grande', HelveticaNeue, Tahoma, Helvetica, 'hiragino kaku gothic pro', sans-serif, 'Apple Color Emoji', 'Segoe UI Emoji', NotoColorEmoji, 'Segoe UI Symbol', 'Android Emoji', EmojiSymbols; font-size: 14px; line-height: 21px;\"><br style=\"color: rgb(85, 85, 85); font-family: 나눔고딕, NanumGothic, NanumGothicOTF, 'Apple Gothic', 맑은고딕, 'Malgun Gothic', dotum, Arial, verdana, 'Trebuchet MS', 'Lucida Grande', HelveticaNeue, Tahoma, Helvetica, 'hiragino kaku gothic pro', sans-serif, 'Apple Color Emoji', 'Segoe UI Emoji', NotoColorEmoji, 'Segoe UI Symbol', 'Android Emoji', EmojiSymbols; font-size: 14px; line-height: 21px;\"><span style=\"color: rgb(85, 85, 85); font-family: Gulim, 굴림, AppleGothic, sans-serif; font-size: 10pt; line-height: 21px;\">이걸 인증샷 사진이랑 같이 기록했고, 지도출력해서 이어붙이고 그 사진이랑 기록을 지도에 붙이기까지.&nbsp;</span><br style=\"color: rgb(85, 85, 85); font-family: 나눔고딕, NanumGothic, NanumGothicOTF, 'Apple Gothic', 맑은고딕, 'Malgun Gothic', dotum, Arial, verdana, 'Trebuchet MS', 'Lucida Grande', HelveticaNeue, Tahoma, Helvetica, 'hiragino kaku gothic pro', sans-serif, 'Apple Color Emoji', 'Segoe UI Emoji', NotoColorEmoji, 'Segoe UI Symbol', 'Android Emoji', EmojiSymbols; font-size: 14px; line-height: 21px;\"><br style=\"color: rgb(85, 85, 85); font-family: 나눔고딕, NanumGothic, NanumGothicOTF, 'Apple Gothic', 맑은고딕, 'Malgun Gothic', dotum, Arial, verdana, 'Trebuchet MS', 'Lucida Grande', HelveticaNeue, Tahoma, Helvetica, 'hiragino kaku gothic pro', sans-serif, 'Apple Color Emoji', 'Segoe UI Emoji', NotoColorEmoji, 'Segoe UI Symbol', 'Android Emoji', EmojiSymbols; font-size: 14px; line-height: 21px;\"><span style=\"color: rgb(85, 85, 85); font-family: Gulim, 굴림, AppleGothic, sans-serif; font-size: 10pt; line-height: 21px;\">시간이 없어서 후기랑 개선책을 못 받아뒀네요. 그거까지 나누면 꽤 괜찮은 활동이 될 거 같아요</span><br></p><p><span style=\"color: rgb(85, 85, 85); font-family: Gulim, 굴림, AppleGothic, sans-serif; font-size: 10pt; line-height: 21px;\"><br></span></p><p><span style=\"color: rgb(85, 85, 85); font-family: Gulim, 굴림, AppleGothic, sans-serif; font-size: 10pt; line-height: 21px;\">----------------------</span></p><p><span style=\"color: rgb(85, 85, 85); font-family: Gulim, 굴림, AppleGothic, sans-serif; font-size: 10pt; line-height: 21px;\"><br></span></p><p><span style=\"color: rgb(85, 85, 85); font-family: Gulim, 굴림, AppleGothic, sans-serif; font-size: 10pt; line-height: 21px;\">2학년 교과시간에 활용해도 좋을 것 같습니다. 질산은만 있으면 애들 물 떠오라고 해서 눈에 보이게 실험가능합니다.</span></p><p><span style=\"color: rgb(85, 85, 85); font-family: Gulim, 굴림, AppleGothic, sans-serif; font-size: 10pt; line-height: 21px;\"><br></span></p><p style=\"line-height: 19.2000007629395px; text-align: center;\"><img src=\"https://t1.daumcdn.net/cfile/cafe/251C623B552D35E323\" class=\"txc-image\" hspace=\"1\" vspace=\"1\" border=\"0\" actualwidth=\"1024\" width=\"1024\" exif=\"{}\" data-filename=\"efeUd015zp8j0haubqr7_m5n86b.jpg\" style=\"clear: none; float: none;\"  id=\"A_251C623B552D35E323E937\"/></p><p style=\"line-height: 19.2000007629395px;\"><span style=\"color: rgb(85, 85, 85); font-family: 나눔고딕, NanumGothic, NanumGothicOTF, 'Apple Gothic', 맑은고딕, 'Malgun Gothic', dotum, Arial, verdana, 'Trebuchet MS', 'Lucida Grande', HelveticaNeue, Tahoma, Helvetica, 'hiragino kaku gothic pro', sans-serif, 'Apple Color Emoji', 'Segoe UI Emoji', NotoColorEmoji, 'Segoe UI Symbol', 'Android Emoji', EmojiSymbols; font-size: 14px; line-height: 21px;\"></span></p><p style=\"line-height: 19.2000007629395px; text-align: center;\"><img src=\"https://t1.daumcdn.net/cfile/cafe/2318333B552D35E525\" class=\"txc-image\" hspace=\"1\" vspace=\"1\" border=\"0\" actualwidth=\"1024\" width=\"1024\" exif=\"{}\" data-filename=\"f9cUd015ogtf57q1rp26_cj8a7j.jpg\" style=\"clear: none; float: none;\"  id=\"A_2318333B552D35E5254887\"/></p><p style=\"line-height: 19.2000007629395px;\"><span style=\"color: rgb(85, 85, 85); font-family: 나눔고딕, NanumGothic, NanumGothicOTF, 'Apple Gothic', 맑은고딕, 'Malgun Gothic', dotum, Arial, verdana, 'Trebuchet MS', 'Lucida Grande', HelveticaNeue, Tahoma, Helvetica, 'hiragino kaku gothic pro', sans-serif, 'Apple Color Emoji', 'Segoe UI Emoji', NotoColorEmoji, 'Segoe UI Symbol', 'Android Emoji', EmojiSymbols; font-size: 14px; line-height: 21px;\"></span></p><p style=\"line-height: 19.2000007629395px; text-align: center;\"><img src=\"https://t1.daumcdn.net/cfile/cafe/2440383B552D35E80C\" class=\"txc-image\" hspace=\"1\" vspace=\"1\" border=\"0\" actualwidth=\"1024\" width=\"1024\" exif=\"{}\" data-filename=\"g3hUd0155itmeyhsamv3_i0usd3.jpg\" style=\"clear: none; float: none;\"  id=\"A_2440383B552D35E80CD713\"/></p><p style=\"line-height: 19.2000007629395px;\"><span style=\"color: rgb(85, 85, 85); font-family: 나눔고딕, NanumGothic, NanumGothicOTF, 'Apple Gothic', 맑은고딕, 'Malgun Gothic', dotum, Arial, verdana, 'Trebuchet MS', 'Lucida Grande', HelveticaNeue, Tahoma, Helvetica, 'hiragino kaku gothic pro', sans-serif, 'Apple Color Emoji', 'Segoe UI Emoji', NotoColorEmoji, 'Segoe UI Symbol', 'Android Emoji', EmojiSymbols; font-size: 14px; line-height: 21px;\"></span></p><p style=\"line-height: 19.2000007629395px; text-align: center;\"><img src=\"https://t1.daumcdn.net/cfile/cafe/2336393B552D35E913\" class=\"txc-image\" hspace=\"1\" vspace=\"1\" border=\"0\" actualwidth=\"1024\" width=\"1024\" exif=\"{}\" data-filename=\"h41Ud015jyun1qa5ppxh_er1k1v.jpg\" style=\"clear: none; float: none;\"  id=\"A_2336393B552D35E913C14F\"/></p><p style=\"line-height: 19.2000007629395px;\"><span style=\"color: rgb(85, 85, 85); font-family: 나눔고딕, NanumGothic, NanumGothicOTF, 'Apple Gothic', 맑은고딕, 'Malgun Gothic', dotum, Arial, verdana, 'Trebuchet MS', 'Lucida Grande', HelveticaNeue, Tahoma, Helvetica, 'hiragino kaku gothic pro', sans-serif, 'Apple Color Emoji', 'Segoe UI Emoji', NotoColorEmoji, 'Segoe UI Symbol', 'Android Emoji', EmojiSymbols; font-size: 14px; line-height: 21px;\"